<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9796] NPE if you call array() method on empty GridLongList</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9796</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    /**
     *
     */
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void testArray() {
        GridLongList list = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; GridLongList();

        &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;long&lt;/span&gt;[] array = list.array();

        assertNotNull(array);

        assertEquals(0, array.length);
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That is it, current version of GridLongList would cause NPE.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
